2. Tab5 firmware (source in firmware/; prebuilt image wideeye-tab5-v<version>.bin in the GitHub releases)
   The prebuilt image contains ESP-IDF (Apache-2.0, with FreeRTOS MIT, Mbed TLS Apache-2.0, TLSF BSD-3-Clause), the
   newlib C library and GCC runtime libraries, M5GFX (MIT, with LovyanGFX FreeBSD and Adafruit GFX BSD), M5Unified (MIT),
   jpeg_decode_enhanced (MIT, in firmware/components/) and glyph pictures drawn with Pretendard (OFL-1.1).
   Full list and license texts: firmware/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt (also attached to each release with the image).
   The flashing tool esptool (GPL-2.0-or-later) is one of the Python packages below; WideEye runs it as a separate program.

